      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "Layer Blend draws its Foreground over its Background the way a paint program stacks layers. Try its Blend Mode \u2014 Screen, Multiply, Difference \u2014 and drag Opacity. To crossfade from one picture to another instead, put a Mix in its place: Amount 0 is all A, 1 is all B."
        }
